{"k":"instruction","text":"In Grafana, create a NEW dashboard: use the New/+ button and choose 'New dashboard' (a blank dashboard with an empty panel). On the new panel, in the query editor select the 'TestData' data source (it may appear as 'grafana-testdata-datasource' or 'TestData'; keep the default scenario). Switch the panel's visualization type to 'Stat' using the visualization type switcher. Set the panel title (in the panel options on the right) to exactly 'rpgr9-r1 Availability'. Then save the dashboard: click Save, name the dashboard exactly 'rpgr9-r1 Bench Dashboard', choose the General folder if asked, and confirm the save. Report the dashboard title and the panel title exactly as shown on screen after saving.","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3000/d/bench-service-health/service-health?from=now-6h&to=now&timezone=browser"}
